      "content": "The suggestion of a web of support is noted. However, my greatest concern is the digital footprint. In this age of constant surveillance, even the most careful movements can be traced back to one's true origins by those looking for me. \n\nHow can I establish these 'alliances' using modern technology and financial systems without leaving a trail that the current ruling families could use to identify my bloodline or my purpose? I need methods that are virtually invisible to high-level digital scrutiny.",
